roject Development”. State the expected outcome and why the selected method fits.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check the outcome against the objective and note a source of error, safety concern or limitation.\n\nMarking guide: meaning/purpose 2; principles/procedure 3; application/example 2; verification/conclusion 1. Check technical details against official course material."'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

